              "type": "string",
              "value": "Data: {{$context.$nodes.SEARCH_FOR_ORGANIZATIONS.$output.items[0]}}\n\nProduce an immediate actionable insight with followUpCommand: ora.Invoke(\"switchOrganization\",{OrganizationCode: <OrganizationCode>, OrganizationName: <OrganizationName>, OrganizationId: <OrganizationId>}) \nParameters should be of json format."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
